[{"title":"人日怀故园","author":"区大相","text":"人日登楼望岁华，可怜久客独思家。\n南中尽道花如锦，北地才看锦作花。\n非关帝里春光少，但惜故园春事早。\n借问花开桃李蹊，何如雪满关山道。\n此日登高且放杯，谁家吹笛上春台。\n未报楼前折新柳，已闻江上落残梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21780,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得吴门市赠庞尉","author":"区大相","text":"君不见梅尉昔游吴门市，本是南昌隐君子。\n暂埋名姓市廛中，曾抗封章汉廷里。\n吴门一鹤唳华亭，君其乘之朝太清。\n不嫌三黜官仍小，更作千秋吏隐名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21781,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张孟奇还山","author":"区大相","text":"四十得官已不早，到官便说还家好。\n未曾半载享荣华，何事终朝太烦恼。\n金马从来有客栖，松门岂合无人扫。\n男儿致身羡青云，君到青云即乞身。\n受恩未报胡言去，有才不试空藏珍。\n古来樵隐俱在野，看君岂是悠悠者。\n满腹经书宜世用，平生意气羞人下。\n驷马高车有祸机，君今此去未为非。\n但恐圣世搜岩穴，我辈安忍负明时。\n南归若访罗浮隐，为言贱子言若斯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21782,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花歌与崔子玉诸公饮花下作","author":"区大相","text":"江南气候足妍和，燕地风沙本自多。\n惟有梅花解人意，乡关客舍共芬华。\n当年花里故人别，今日花前为谁折。\n玉椀银缸赏已新，毡毹锦帐香未歇。\n醉把瑶华揽子裾，莫教羌笛怨离居。\n上苑花枝犹若此，故园春色定何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21783,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叶县歌","author":"区大相","text":"洪潦纵横兮泥途深，车不得轨行兮马力不任。\n日将暮兮天愁阴，望佳人兮伤予心，安得双凫兮驾汝翩翩而来临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21784,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮归山中","author":"区大相","text":"田家落日闲，茅屋对秋山。\n片霭将林暮，孤云共鸟还。\n人烟流水外，村杵夕檐间。\n萝月时相待，翛然返故关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21785,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日阮溪","author":"区大相","text":"溪边多胜事，倚杖惜芳晨。\n幽径迟来客，孤亭独坐人。\n莺将花作友，云与水俱春。\n多谢求仙者，何如此问津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21786,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石门舟中","author":"区大相","text":"壁势临江断，涛声入海遥。\n众流趋郡国，万舸逐风潮。\n越峤王封壮，秦军伯气销。\n图南安所适，行矣见扶摇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21787,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东行纪兴","author":"区大相","text":"落日泛舟返，沧波通远天。\n未逢三岛使，还访五羊仙。\n珠树秋云泾，瑶台夕霭悬。\n兴来随所适，沿月棹江烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21788,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安期岩 其一","author":"区大相","text":"昔闻采药去，过海访蓬壶。\n尚忆如瓜枣，难寻九节蒲。\n鹤鸣犹绕树，云起类披图。\n借问阜乡舄，何如叶县凫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21789,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安期岩 其二","author":"区大相","text":"长谣白雪曲，一扣紫岩扉。\n陟磴岚随杖，搴萝翠滴衣。\n瑶华纷可掇，仙峤望中微。\n海上三清鸟，传书几岁归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21790,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏拟少年行","author":"区大相","text":"少年何倜傥，结束似金张。\n惯贳文君酒，新薰荀令香。\n卖珠过主第，掷果向河阳。\n秦氏称殊婿，王家早拜郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21791,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"友人读书诃林","author":"区大相","text":"闻道栖禅客，观空不废书。\n萝轩僧梵寂，木榻世情疏。\n贝叶藏山鸟，昙花隐壁鱼。\n由来方丈室，即是草玄居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21792,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜闻雁","author":"区大相","text":"汀洲春水生，旅雁动乡情。\n复此联翩起，犹含关塞声。\n云低时乱叫，雾阻或单鸣。\n独坐悬灯夕，因风寄远征。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21793,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒居","author":"区大相","text":"茅斋云木里，寒日转萧森。\n幽独生春事，清虚长道心。\n闭关惟纵酒，拥褐且长吟。\n一枉朋知过，门前车迹深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21794,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦日食 其一","author":"区大相","text":"未献椒花颂，先逢日食书。\n蓂生春暗发，麟斗事非虚。\n不尽如钩挂，新回似月初。\n卿云方启旦，光烂奉晖馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21795,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦日食 其二","author":"区大相","text":"献岁冠裳集，朝正祲霭多。\n圣朝无阙失，天意竟如何。\n匣镜朝晖没，开轩夕照过。\n定知天有日，无待鲁阳戈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21796,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晴","author":"区大相","text":"香阁惜春归。\n妆楼宜曙晖。\n池纹含细簟，花气透重帏。\n林鸟千回啭，园桃一半飞。\n韶光处处好，结伴采芳菲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21797,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春思","author":"区大相","text":"春光无远近，都讶艳阳时。\n蝶稚初涂粉，蚕眠欲咡丝。\n陇云归雁早，海日到窗迟。\n惆怅芳菲里，佳期那得知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21798,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏作临镜","author":"区大相","text":"纱窗催曙鸟，绣阁捲香帏。\n开匣自生妒，看妆谁谓非。\n怜时嫌著粉，愁处懒更衣。\n回视雕梁燕，双双犹未飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21799,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"烽烟完节诗 其一","author":"区大相","text":"虐焰昏炎徼，惊烽煽绿林。\n岂缘宋姬笑，遂断木兰吟。\n抱柱岂为信，登台良独任。\n惟应芦火玉，堪自表贞心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21800,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"烽烟完节诗 其二","author":"区大相","text":"忍说干戈日，仍钦妇子贤。\n膏薰何用比，烽火故相煎。\n烈性金同炼，芳心桂共燃。\n当为镆铘剑，长誓斩蛮烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21801,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过韶石 其一","author":"区大相","text":"玉辇南巡日，从天降九韶。\n仍闻舞百兽，真想格三苗。\n风雨仙灵集，云霞绛节朝。\n有时磐石上，天籁暮萧萧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21802,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过韶石 其二","author":"区大相","text":"轩帝钧天后，重华复此乡。\n皇风开楚越，大乐睹虞黄。\n石上停仙跸，云端识衮裳。\n珠丘不可望，流恨满潇湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21803,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭上望中原 其一","author":"区大相","text":"岭树郁苍苍，千峰划大荒。\n路盘秦栈没，天入楚云长。\n地旷留铜柱，春深贡越裳。\n古来思猛士，无乃固金汤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21804,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭上望中原 其二","author":"区大相","text":"行行踰叠嶂，立马倚崔嵬。\n关路元通汉，将军是姓梅。\n山川百越尽，云雾五陵开。\n倘上筹边疏，安危敢论才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21805,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度滁关望凤阳","author":"区大相","text":"环滁山不断，西尽白云封。\n遥辨金陵气，知从泗水龙。\n河冰妨渡马，涧雪倒枯松。\n侧想涂山会，来王万国宗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21806,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐州道中","author":"区大相","text":"彭城徐子国，访古气弥增。\n饥雀啄残雪，春泉汲断冰。\n台临青垒迥，山隐白云层。\n客路随征雁，翩翩向五陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21807,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓渡临淮河","author":"区大相","text":"县城临渡口，晓涉是春冰。\n日月开淮甸，山川入汉陵。\n临渊徒有羡，履薄得无兢。\n立望龙兴地，风云时自腾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21808,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日边思","author":"区大相","text":"劳歌倦行迈，长路改年华。\n野冻冰胶岸，风鸣马喷沙。\n夕烽标汉垒，宵月惨胡笳。\n谁念穷边戍，春来不见家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21809,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南还潞河玩月 其一","author":"区大相","text":"潞河堤上月，清景忆皇州。\n心逐孤轮转，光看万里流。\n花阴辞北渚，帆影溯南洲。\n独有江楼望，应同今夜愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21810,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南还潞河玩月 其二","author":"区大相","text":"轮生云不碍，弦上桂还侵。\n披雾光逾皎，临河影讵沉。\n望回霄汉迥，看去海门深。\n别有南飞鹊，徘徊绕上林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21811,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏咏扇上画兰","author":"区大相","text":"新制齐纨扇，画作楚皋兰。\n叶叶幽闺性，花花彼美看。\n动摇晨露湿，怀袖香风寒。\n芳意宜连理，嘉名应合欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21812,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又咏扇上画兰","author":"区大相","text":"美人怀藻思，碧草寄幽情。\n露叶迎香发，风枝任兴生。\n相怜春畹暮，相倚月轮清。\n若持掩歌脸，吐气必俱馨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21813,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛舟","author":"区大相","text":"汀洲暑气微，烟艇泛晴晖。\n鱼拨菱花动，鸥冲桂桨飞。\n下溪逢浣女，面水缉荷衣。\n相见时相问，郎今何处归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21814,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上吊屈庙 其一","author":"区大相","text":"楚臣昔见放，遗庙楚江阴。\n憔悴当年色，凄凉千载吟。\n碧云湘浦远，春草洞湖深。\n魂去招何处，遥遥枫树林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21815,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上吊屈庙 其二","author":"区大相","text":"去国情如昨，怀归复几时。\n皇天难具问，公子敢言思。\n风雨湘灵泣，鱼龙梦泽悲。\n九歌君不见，空自撷江蓠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21816,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将至故园志喜","author":"区大相","text":"自予出京国，迢递望山阿。\n客路厌风水，丘园寄薜萝。\n枫林青岸合，桂浦白云多。\n试问长堤草，年年奈别何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21817,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪上独往命酒自随","author":"区大相","text":"清溪行不极，徐步即幽深。\n草识归人兴，禽疑久客心。\n鱼梁明落照，鸡犬隔空林。\n不藉芳醪色，谁能慰独吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21818,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"本空上人禅定西村寄怀","author":"区大相","text":"西郊开净域，一水向珠林。\n鸟下斋前几，灯传定后心。\n钟声流木杪，松子落岩阴。\n借问修持苦，应怜绮障深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21819,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对雪和四兄","author":"区大相","text":"早雨晚仍雪，风花湿更乾。\n糁枝成玉树，铺径作瑶坛。\n赋里窥春易，尊前和曲难。\n莫将柳絮句，轻拟撒盐看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21820,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过亡友陈伯衡故居","author":"区大相","text":"云房披素幔，雪涕访遗尘。\n竹石对今雨，图书非故人。\n鸟啼深巷静，花映古苔春。\n何处风前笛，悲来过四邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21821,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又咏黎秘书汲古亭","author":"区大相","text":"石井何年凿，林亭向水源。\n梧疏翻月影，栏古浸苔痕。\n抱瓮忘机事，开畦远市喧。\n桔槔宁用此，聊灌汉阴园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21822,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏马台 其一","author":"区大相","text":"乾坤龙战日，西楚气雄哉。\n叱咤千人废，腾骧独马来。\n云深钜鹿野，日落彭城台。\n霸业何销歇，伤心但草莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21823,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏马台 其二","author":"区大相","text":"芒砀吞大泽，台上起悲风。\n汉世人心属，君王马步工。\n孤城苍树断，野戍暮烟空。\n独有彭门会，高秋怀宋公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21824,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏燕市","author":"区大相","text":"五方殊物产，百货丽皇居。\n高足千金外，双环万镒馀。\n三川谢声利，陆海让车书。\n但和酒人筑，休停卿士舆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21825,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别汪和叔之塞上","author":"区大相","text":"花前各尽觞，游子赋河梁。\n我望南枝返，君同北雁翔。\n笳声咽陇底，海色愁渔阳。\n未共酬恩去，相思塞草长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21826,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出京汪公干追送至潞河别往上谷再赠","author":"区大相","text":"临河驱去马，送远各依依。\n穷路难为别，游人俱未归。\n雪残边草出，沙涨碛花飞。\n莫更听燕筑，徒沾壮士衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21827,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出上东门","author":"区大相","text":"上东东首路，车马无时闲。\n日日见行客，朝朝思故山。\n地枢连九陌，天阙表重关。\n借问频来往，何人剩壮颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21828,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏车","author":"区大相","text":"鸣銮遵广陌，缓辔动轻埃。\n上路流如水，长桥殷似雷。\n朱轮随日转，翠幰拂云来。\n不见渭川载，徒思托乘才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21829,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得泥融飞燕子","author":"区大相","text":"泥融碧草芳，紫燕远相将。\n衔来微带湿，巢处定闻香。\n对舞玉池水，双栖文杏梁。\n袖中书未寄，夫婿隔湖湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21830,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得沙暖睡鸳鸯","author":"区大相","text":"沙上眠鸳鸟，雌雄不异林。\n东风吹欲醉，渌水照同心。\n上客赠文绮，佳人思锦衾。\n昨宵春梦去，惟恨玉关深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21831,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发清源开先载酒道傍一醉而别 其一","author":"区大相","text":"遑遑问归路，与子暂盘桓。\n岁月分襟易，风尘把袂难。\n离觞促日短，旅服过春寒。\n意气今何在，惟将宝剑看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21832,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发清源开先载酒道傍一醉而别 其二","author":"区大相","text":"下马饮君酒，酒酣愁奈何。\n离颜正萧索，客计且蹉跎。\n荆玉售何晚，鲛珠泪渐多。\n平生惟有恨，中路一悲歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21833,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过吕梁","author":"区大相","text":"临河发棹唱，聊得洗尘机。\n夕鸟度山翠，空梁沉暮霏。\n孔观人已远，庄记事多违。\n从此茫茫去，中流击枻归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21834,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日同诸客泛舟青溪作 其一","author":"区大相","text":"东城杨柳陌，西堰木兰船。\n锦缆清川曲，朱楼大道边。\n花阴随去棹，鸟韵杂鸣弦。\n别有淩波态，回看洛浦仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21835,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日同诸客泛舟青溪作 其二","author":"区大相","text":"解佩临青岸，鸣环步绿浔。\n川如濯锦艳，溪比浣纱深。\n倚楫吴姬唱，褰芳越客吟。\n江南佳丽地，最此称游心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21836,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日同诸客泛舟青溪作 其三","author":"区大相","text":"锦席人须醉，仙舟客共登。\n年华各自惜，意气转相矜。\n瓶水沉朱李，溪花覆紫菱。\n莫誇姑射雪，吾有玉壶冰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21837,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日同诸客泛舟青溪作 其四","author":"区大相","text":"捲幔千花暝，回舟一水遥。\n芳情瑶瑟怨，别曲凤笙调。\n桂苑通仙阁，兰房接画桥。\n倚歌待明月，长笛不须邀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21838,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵城南宴","author":"区大相","text":"逸客东山至，佳人南国多。\n袖翻金谷舞，梁绕石城歌。\n妆阁宜春入，花蹊爱晚过。\n留欢方待月，无遽动鸣珂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21839,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊峨眉亭玩月 其一","author":"区大相","text":"昔贤临泛后，重系木兰舟。\n山月此亭古，风烟何代愁。\n鹊飞犹绕树，杯渡欲随流。\n多少婵娟恨，何须访醉游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21840,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊峨眉亭玩月 其二","author":"区大相","text":"由来对酒处，高咏渺难闻。\n万古青天月，清辉殊为君。\n凄凉同逐客，怅望独离群。\n盈手犹堪赠，长歌寄碧云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21841,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题贞吉王孙幻景庵","author":"区大相","text":"汉室诸王子，沙门大士家。\n桂开仙院叶，莲发曲池花。\n讲席窥山鸟，禅衣落涧霞。\n中林亦何事，长日演三车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21842,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚发豫章江上","author":"区大相","text":"迩来山水趣，独在豫章船。\n正有登临兴，其如旅病牵。\n抱琴传此意，栖岳计何年。\n暮倚中流楫，闻歌徒自怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21843,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赣州阻水","author":"区大相","text":"两涯新涨满，系缆动乡愁。\n万岭盘溪落，双桥带郡流。\n行人迷旧渡，宿鹭没前洲。\n失路今如此，谁能赋远游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21844,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自南野驿赴横浦","author":"区大相","text":"溪路多纡折，一程数十滩。\n崖欹度缆险，石浅溯舟难。\n樵径迷深竹，鸥矶坐急湍。\n任君归思切，信宿且加餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21845,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秘黎公挽词 其一","author":"区大相","text":"一代词宗丧，三朝侍史荣。\n芸香馀旧草，风雅变新声。\n宦路终蓬阁，归魂必玉京。\n茂陵求见及，犹想禅书成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21846,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秘黎公挽词 其二","author":"区大相","text":"晚节慕丹丘，长生事可求。\n谁言已年梦，竟作岱宗游。\n海暗千珠色，山空八桂秋。\n平生知己泪，零落向西州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21847,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秘黎公挽词 其三","author":"区大相","text":"山中朝沐罢，地下忽修文。\n日黯炎洲树，江寒桂水云。\n风松吟旧馆，露草泣孤坟。\n欲拟招魂些，泉台恐不闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21848,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]